  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "fix: Hmac Missing in SSH",
  "description": "The **peer->mac** Algorithm is not should set NULL here. The above\nssh_decryption_set_cipher_id function takes **peer->enc**, and set\npeer->cipher to NULL in else case, the peer->cipher is the field of\nstruct ssh_peer_data, but not have corresponding field with **peer->mac** in\nstruct ssh_peer_data.So I just delete it in else case.\n\nSetting **peer->mac** to NULL case \"mac:%s%s\" and \"implicit\" missing.I tested it with same pcaps in 3.6.22 and 4.2.4 version, but it does not have same result.It only can show hmac-sha2-256.",
  "state": "merged",
